<title>USA: First Lancaster Q2 Dec 31 net $0.16.</title>
<headline>First Lancaster Q2 Dec 31 net $0.16.</headline>
<dateline>LANCASTER, Pa. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Lancaster Bancshares Inc said on Monday its net income for the second quarter of fiscal 1997 was $142,362, or $0.16 per share.</p>
<p>For the six months ending December 31, net income was $197,690, or $0.22 per share.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
